2. **Architecture Check**: Which layer does this belong to? (App/System/Service/Device/IOIF)
3. **Protocol Analysis**: Does this involve DOP (Data Object Protocol)? If yes, analyze existing patterns in `cm_drv.c` or `data_object.c` first.
